  "result": "Confirmed: `comment-service.ts` is the publisher (calls `emit(\"comment.created\", ...)`), not a handler — it's correctly excluded.\n\nThe `comment.created` event is published by `comment-service.ts` when a comment is posted. Four services register handlers reacting to it via `subscribe(\"comment.created\", ...)`: `activity-service.ts` (records an activity feed entry), `notification-service.ts` (fans out notifications to mentioned/watching users), `search-service.ts` (updates the search index), and `webhook-service.ts` (dispatches outbound webhooks). Files that only declare/type the event name (`src/types/event.ts`, `src/types/notification.ts`, `src/types/activity.ts`, schema files, UI components referencing the string) are not handlers.\n\nANSWER: src/server/services/activity-service.ts, src/server/services/notification-service.ts, src/server/services/search-service.ts, src/server/services/webhook-service.ts",
